# dashboard/frontend/dist is deliberately committed: the add-on image is
# Python-only so it installs fast on Raspberry Pi class hardware. Run
# `npm run build` in dashboard/frontend before committing frontend changes.

# Cloud-sync conflict copies, e.g. "DevicePicker 2.jsx" or "entity-1x1-light 2.png".
# Byte-identical duplicates of files this repo already has. They are invisible to
# the editor -- widgetShots.js joins the shots directory against index.json and
# they are in neither -- but import.meta.glob bundles whatever is on disk, so 37
# of them silently added 89kB to the bundle during the 0.22.0 release. Ignoring
# them stops them being committed; the real fix is to stop the sync client
# watching this folder.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
